  "collspec.iiif.texte": "IIIF (International Image Interoperability Framework, pronounced “triple-eye-eff”) is an open standard used by libraries, archives and museums around the world to share their digitized images. It lets you zoom deeply into a document, compare several side by side and open it in any other compatible viewer through its manifest.",
