  "collspec.accueil.titre": "Special <br> Collections",

  "collspec.accueil.intro.lead": "Our special collections are filled with unique, old, and rare items, ready to enrich research and teaching, or even become objects of research themselves!",
  "collspec.accueil.intro.para1": "Browsing the different fonds means discovering the past through our rare and ancient books, artifacts, and image collections — from remarkable pieces to recent digitizations, explore our thematic selection of documents and objects from our fonds.",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.titre": "Discover our unique pieces",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.description": "The special collections of the Université de Montréal Libraries feature unique, historic and rare materials that offer many possibilities for research, study and teaching. Browse the various fonds and explore these rich collections through the digitized materials available in this digital space.",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.description2": "Within the UdeM Libraries network, the <a href=\"https://bib.umontreal.ca/espaces/blrcs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rare Books and Special Collections Library</a> holds a large part of these collections. A true living research laboratory, it brings together manuscripts, books, images and other forms of expression that open up new perspectives. On site, its team supports you in your research and in consulting and working with the materials.",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.bouton": "Discover the library",

